flowchart TD
  A[Person A swipes LIKE on Person B] --> S[Persist directed Swipe A → B]
  S --> Q{Does B → A LIKE already exist?}
  Q -- No --> P[Keep one-sided interest private]
  P --> F[No Match record; no incoming-like signal in feed]
  Q -- Yes --> T[Create canonical Match in same transaction]
  T --> R[Return matched=true to the caller]
  R --> UI[UI may show “It's a match!”]
